{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\eng\\097.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "2 The words given in the box represent various sports which are either played", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[64, 142], [1059, 151], [1059, 194], [63, 185]]}, {"text": "on land, water, air or snow. Fill in the table with the correct sports. Use a", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[101, 181], [1015, 192], [1014, 231], [100, 220]]}, {"text": "dictionary to find the correct meanings of these words to help you put them", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[100, 219], [1062, 231], [1062, 271], [99, 259]]}, {"text": "in the correct columns.", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[102, 260], [407, 269], [406, 296], [101, 286]]}, {"text": "Farugliding", "conf": 0.745, "box": [[131, 329], [280, 332], [280, 369], [130, 367]]}, {"text": "skiing", "conf": 0.815, "box": [[382, 332], [460, 338], [457, 374], [379, 368]]}, {"text": "swimming", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[561, 335], [684, 340], [683, 375], [560, 370]]}, {"text": "snowboarding", "conf": 0.832, "box": [[735, 337], [901, 342], [901, 377], [734, 372]]}, {"text": "hiking", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[979, 338], [1062, 343], [1060, 378], [977, 373]]}, {"text": "treking", "conf": 0.817, "box": [[152, 393], [261, 398], [259, 431], [151, 427]]}, {"text": "bike", "conf": 0.799, "box": [[390, 400], [450, 403], [448, 436], [388, 434]]}, {"text": "riding", "conf": 0.843, "box": [[584, 396], [664, 404], [660, 443], [580, 435]]}, {"text": "rowing", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[774, 400], [862, 406], [860, 444], [771, 438]]}, {"text": "cycling", "conf": 0.823, "box": [[975, 402], [1066, 404], [1065, 443], [974, 441]]}, {"text": "fishing", "conf": 0.792, "box": [[374, 459], [462, 466], [459, 500], [372, 494]]}, {"text": "parasailing", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[553, 466], [683, 468], [682, 503], [552, 501]]}, {"text": "skateboarding", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[731, 468], [896, 470], [896, 504], [730, 502]]}, {"text": "water", "conf": 0.824, "box": [[439, 534], [520, 537], [519, 568], [438, 565]]}, {"text": "air", "conf": 0.623, "box": [[719, 541], [761, 541], [761, 573], [719, 573]]}, {"text": "Use of Language", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[121, 745], [427, 754], [425, 794], [120, 785]]}, {"text": "Thn Be verbs", "conf": 0.688, "box": [[70, 841], [292, 844], [292, 875], [69, 872]]}, {"text": "The present tense describes an action that happens regularly.", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[68, 896], [805, 908], [804, 944], [67, 932]]}, {"text": "Forexample,", "conf": 0.865, "box": [[70, 941], [233, 941], [233, 968], [70, 968]]}, {"text": "We play cricket every Sunday.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[67, 972], [445, 978], [445, 1012], [66, 1006]]}, {"text": "If you use 'is' and 'are' with present simple, it changes into a \"be' verb. A 'be' verb is used", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[68, 1048], [1126, 1062], [1125, 1096], [67, 1082]]}, {"text": "when a sentence does not have a main verb, rather than linking verbs. It does not", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[67, 1086], [1045, 1101], [1045, 1133], [66, 1118]]}, {"text": "describe an action rather tells us more about the subject of the sentence.", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[68, 1123], [945, 1138], [945, 1171], [67, 1156]]}, {"text": "Weuseam/is/areas,", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[68, 1163], [337, 1167], [337, 1197], [67, 1192]]}, {"text": "The main verb", "conf": 0.812, "box": [[243, 1240], [440, 1243], [440, 1272], [242, 1269]]}, {"text": "A helping verb", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[657, 1245], [837, 1248], [836, 1282], [657, 1279]]}, {"text": "Forexample,", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[68, 1318], [232, 1318], [232, 1348], [68, 1348]]}, {"text": "Pakistan is home to a number of regional and local sports.", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[68, 1354], [777, 1361], [777, 1391], [67, 1384]]}, {"text": "In the above mentioned sentence 'is is used as the main verb as there is no main verb in", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[67, 1391], [1132, 1402], [1131, 1434], [66, 1422]]}, {"text": "the sentence.", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[68, 1431], [243, 1435], [242, 1464], [67, 1460]]}, {"text": "Remember, we use 'is' with singular nouns and 'are' with plural nouns. For example,", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[68, 1502], [1065, 1512], [1065, 1548], [67, 1538]]}, {"text": "Fishing in the nearby streams and Shandur Lake is a popular activity.", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[68, 1542], [893, 1548], [893, 1584], [67, 1578]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.836, "box": [[265, 1631], [476, 1628], [476, 1657], [265, 1660]]}, {"text": "90", "conf": 0.664, "box": [[599, 1627], [646, 1627], [646, 1663], [599, 1663]]}, {"text": "awaz e inqilab.com", "conf": 0.866, "box": [[480, 1710], [760, 1710], [760, 1740], [480, 1740]]}]}